      {
        "id": 128425,
        "name": "Reckless",
        "username": "Reckless",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-31T15:03:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>While I’m with you on the subject, Rabit, I think this forum does have a tendency to run wild with rumor and can state something as fact when it hasn’t been confirmed. It’s always someone’s own responsibility to check their sources, granted, but this isn’t the first time there has been confusion in the ranks over “he said/she said,” and I doubt it will be the last! XD</p>\n<p>Check your sources, folks! It’s just the neighborly thing to do!</p>",
